 "tags": [
  {
   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Resilience Hub API (2020-04-30). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Resiliency policies and applications are stored metadata: no resource is imported or resolved, no assessment, drift check or recommendation runs and no event is sent to the subscribed SNS topics, so applications report no compliance, drift, resiliency score or estimated cost tier. Scheduled Daily assessments are refused and clearResiliencyPolicyArn is not supported; a referenced policyArn must name a stored policy, but deleting a policy does not check the applications that use it. App versions, components, resources, input sources, assessments, recommendations, suggested policies, grouping recommendations and metrics return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. ListApps filters by name and ARNs only, and delete client tokens are accepted without replay.",
   "name": "AWS Resilience Hub"
  }
 ],
